{"parse": {"title": "CO-02", "pageid": 100916, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-01\" title=\"CO-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-03\" title=\"CO-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.85.E8.A1.8C.E8.80.85.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"旅行者们\">旅行者们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 旅行者们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Voyagers</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>三<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>难<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>星<span class=\"color-value\"></span>星<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台节目：</div><div>“不久前，旅行者二号已顺利抵达天王星，完成了人类历史上首次对这颗星球进行的探测活动，并按计划对天王星环系统进行了考察……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台节目：</div><div>“由于探访土卫六造成的临时轨道变动，旅行者一号仍在飞往太阳系边缘……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台节目：</div><div>“它们今后的旅程……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷静的新闻播报声骤然中断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>它们接下来要去哪里，做了什么，都是已经确认的结果，不用听过时的消息啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我记得拉普拉斯的资料库里还收藏过1990年旅行者一号拍的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>也有三进制计算机和流星余迹通信技术的研发报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>但资料库里没有记载过那张金唱片的下落，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>说不定在哪次播报里就会提到，“根据旅行者一号骤然减少的质量，我们判断，其上搭载的唱片已经被不知名的存在截获……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>“截获”听起来像星际海盗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我想海盗应该对一张小小的金唱片不感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>说吧，按掉我的收音机是为了什么要紧事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>简单小事。他们说录像最好不要有太多杂音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现在差不多够安静了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">1986 4月 普列谢茨克发射基地</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">冷周六，拉普拉斯研究中心职员。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">加入计划的原因？爱好而已。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">Правда? </span><br /><span style=\"font-size:111%\">“真的吗？”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">为了避免你太惊讶，我会做个更详细点的介绍。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:94%\"><i><b>到地方没有？该死，我讨厌一切爬行以外的交通方式！</b></i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:94%\"><i><b>但你绝大多数时间都在“搭乘交通工具”。</b></i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">迪布瓦家族兄弟姐妹中的九分之二。以聒噪为美德。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">或许是天气太冷，其他家伙将所有时间都用来睡觉。感谢他们的沉默，让我还能保留点耐心。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由远及近的脚步声促使他们抬头张望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>您好，我来接您前往办公室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>请先出示您的工牌……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:94%\"><b><i>嘶嘶。</i></b></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>啊，抱歉——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">我的耐心耗尽了。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_lengzhouliuzoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小蛇灵活地偏开身子，但它躲得不够快，只能被迫闭紧嘴巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>多谢您为我领路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>再走快些怎么样？这地方的温度连开口说句话都够呛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">到了目的地，我会再次、再次、再次教他们不要随便吓唬同事。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>您放心，办公室内的暖气二十四小时开启。拉普拉斯不会忽略这种细节。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b><span style=\"font-size:138%\">事实上，作为一位爬行动物爱好者，<br />她正忙着掩饰自己因惊喜造成的失礼。</span></b></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>就是这里。您直接敲门就好，指针女士应该正在里面等您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>对了，刚才您提到了气候问题，请问您可爱的宠物是否需要恒温箱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>我们会在合理范围内尽量满足每位研究员的需求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，没事。我的外套参考了一些类似原理，完全够用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>好的。另外，发射基地的这处办公场地专为合作研究建设。如果您有事前往拉普拉斯专用办公楼，记得提前提交访问申请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>那儿在极圈附近，过去有些远，来往管控也很严格。为避免耽误日程，希望您记住这一流程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>普列谢茨克发射基地研究所，欢迎您的加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员刚走出几步，又被细微的声响吸引着回过头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鳞片金黄的小蛇朝她吐着信子，似乎还瞧得见它眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>再见，小家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员的背影消失在走廊尽头，愉快的说话声再次响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:94%\"><b><i>你知道吗，二号？我觉得这地方的人对我们更友好。</i></b></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的素质简直越来越差了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不准用编号叫我。还有，别惹太多麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>再收到任何关于“实验动物被偷吃”的投诉，我就给你打结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在家族辩论赛正式打响前，房门及时地敞开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我听到外面有动静，原来真有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>别杵在门口。你就是那个主动申请调来这里的研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>看样子，你是我的新同事？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新同事的态度谈不上欢迎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但踏进房间，看清楚所有陈设后，她意识到这点细节已经是最不重要的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>两台设备，两把椅子……两张制式办公桌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>整个组就只有我们两个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>当然不，记得保持严谨！组里有足足三个人。不过第三个人从来没在公示名单以外的地方出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>暂时别算上那位政府派来的协作者——我用这个词完全是出于尊重——这里确实只有两位员工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>怎么样，也算是个惊喜吧？至少项目经费怎么用只需要我俩做决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>当然也别指望能有多少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>行，和我预想中也挺接近，特殊时期的边缘项目……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>到底是谁想到要用传送术式往航天器上送补给？我真佩服那家伙的想象力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>你觉得这是异想天开？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当然不，充分利用一切知识才是科学研究的秘诀，我一向赞成神秘学与科技的结合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这一定会是科学发展的主流趋势，尽管现在还不是，但……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>但未来一定会的。或许改变的第一步就是从这个项目开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>要是能改进传送术式的缺陷，解决它单程、不稳定、距离过短的问题，这就不会再是边缘项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>看来我们的合作会很顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起桌面上堆叠的材料，给自己腾出一小块便于倚靠的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>为了我们共同的目标，当务之急是先做出些值得填上报告书的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我知道你擅长的是空间材料科学。需要什么，这位专家？我来帮您想办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>考虑到审批流程、运输时间，还有其他一系列影响因素，我今天得提交新的领用单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我想想，也没什么特别的……你怕不怕鱼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这次话题实在转折得太快，即使是惯于处理信息的大脑也无法立刻做出反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针停顿了足足三秒，还是决定回答这个荒谬的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……不怕。我对你养在头上的小宠物也没有意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好，看来我的确来对了地方，没人会反对我关于鱼类养殖的这点儿爱好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>至于我头上的生物——这是另一件事，虽然我是没把身份背景贴在脸上，但好歹在档案里……你没看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>“能多个帮手就不错，管他是谁呢！”然后把文件随手摞在废纸堆顶层。我猜对了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>真聪明。我扫了两眼，记得你的研究方向和过往经验。其他东西不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但也得解释清楚嘛。蛇发女妖和蛇打从出生起就在一块儿，比起宠物，更像同胞的兄弟姐妹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>——所以你其实多了九位同事，算上我在内。够不够惊喜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>很新奇的知识。可惜我们恐怕发不出九份补贴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>五份？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>正常发放，可以在常规份额上额外增加饮食津贴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>加上单间办公室，我需要地方放我的生态缸。鱼类和绿植有助于放松心情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>那就推进进度，把报告书写完，申请新办公室——一人一间，怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>成交。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>协议达成。指针顺势抬起右手，打算来个友善的击掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小蛇抢先一步探出身子，用头顶轻轻碰了碰指针的掌心。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:277%\">合作愉快。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-02"}}